<title>JAPAN: Japan May housing starts down 9.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan May housing starts down 9.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's housing starts in May fell 9.6 percent from a year earlier to 123,478 units, the fifth consecutive month in which they had marked a year-on-year decline, the Construction Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>					May starts   yr/yr pct change</p>
<p> Private homes			48,204	    -10.9</p>
<p> Rental homes			 41,545	    -16.5</p>
<p> Employee housing		    2,833	     -5.8</p>
<p> Housing built for sale	   30,896	     +4.1</p>
<p>  Condominiums			18,017	    +11.5</p>
<p> Total				 123,478	     -9.6</p>
</text>
